## How to use it — three on-ramps

1. **You have a coding agent** (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Copilot, Amp…): open this repo with it and say **"Read IMPLEMENT.md and walk me through it."**
2. **You have a chat-only AI:** paste `IMPLEMENT.md` into the chat, create the files yourself, and keep `STATUS.md` as a note you paste back each session.
3. **No AI at all:** read `IMPLEMENT.md` yourself — every step is doable by hand.

**Model recommendation:** run the install on the most capable model you have, at high reasoning effort.

